RipsMath_PrizeForRankInTier
├── when the tier has a single winner
│   └── it should return the min prize.
└── when the tier has multiple winners
    ├── when the rank is first in the tier
    │   └── it should return the min prize.
    ├── when the rank is last in the tier
    │   └── it should return the max prize.
    └── when the rank is in the middle of the tier
        └── it should linearly interpolate between min and max prize.
